  "profile": {
    "storyTitle": "Profile",
    "text": "Scene, photographer, specializes in using her photography auxiliary equipment, a robotic buggy named 'Lens,' to survey the battlefield. She provides visual information and works to provide field investigation and battlefield reconnaissance services to Rhodes Island. However, Scene's athletic abilities are extremely limited, so the support of logistics operators are absolutely crucial."
